// optlist.js — the option list.
// C ref: include/optlist.h allopt_init[] (NHOPT_PARSE), as configured for
// the recorder's tty build: ALTMETA, INSURANCE, CRASHREPORT, STATUS_HILITES,
// TTY_GRAPHICS, PREV_MSGS, NEWS and DEBUG are defined; CURSES_GRAPHICS,
// CHANGE_COLOR, SCORE_ON_BOTL, TIMED_DELAY (NO_TIMED_DELAY), SND_*,
// TTY_*_ESCCODES, VIDEOSHADES, WINCHAIN, MICRO, MSDOS and WIN32 are not.
// 'addr' names the boolean's location as [struct, field]: flags, iflags,
// a11y or u.uroleplay; 'optfn' names the option's handler in options.js.
// Generated from optlist.h; the entries keep optlist.h's order (opt_* enum).

